# DENY EVERYTHING BY DEFAULT.
#
# This directory holds .credentials.json, full session transcripts under
# projects/, shell snapshots, and telemetry. None of that may ever be tracked.
# Nothing is committed unless it is explicitly un-ignored below, so a new file
# appearing in ~/.claude is untracked by default rather than by remembering.
#
# Before adding a "!" line, ask whether that path can ever contain a secret.
# settings.json is deliberately NOT tracked: its `env` block is a common place
# for API keys.

*

!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md

!agents/
!agents/*.md

!commands/
!commands/*.md

!.claude-plugin/
!.claude-plugin/*.json

# Skills are un-ignored one by one, never as skills/**: ~/.claude/skills/synced/
# holds claude.ai's own synced skills and their manifest, which must stay out.
# Each listed folder is static third-party skill text plus its LICENSE.
!skills/
!skills/THIRD_PARTY.md
!skills/systematic-debugging/
!skills/systematic-debugging/**
!skills/security-audit/
!skills/security-audit/**
!skills/code-review-and-quality/
!skills/code-review-and-quality/**
!skills/code-simplification/
!skills/code-simplification/**
!skills/simplify-codebase/
!skills/simplify-codebase/**
!skills/configure-knip/
!skills/configure-knip/**
!skills/clean-git-repo/
!skills/clean-git-repo/**
!skills/api-design-principles/
!skills/api-design-principles/**
!skills/architecture-patterns/
!skills/architecture-patterns/**
